    </div></div>
    </div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">Node*</span> current = Head;</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">Node</span> current = Head;</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p><code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">Node* current = Head;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">Node current = Head;</code></p>
         <p>In plain words: <em>create a new pointer that starts at the first node.</em></p>$q$, $q$<p><code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">Node* current = Head;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">Node current = Head;</code></p>
         <p>يعني: <em>اعمل Pointer جديد يبدأ من أول Node.</em></p>$q$);
