    </div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>cout &lt;&lt; current-&gt;data;</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>System.out.println(current.data);</code></pre></div><div class="bg-gray-900 text-emerald-400 rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-sm text-center" dir="ltr">10</div>$q$, $q$<p><code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code> is pointing here. If we print it with <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">cout &lt;&lt; current-&gt;data;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">System.out.println(current.data);</code>, it prints <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code>.</p>$q$, $q$<p>current بيشاور هنا. لو عايز أطبعها <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">cout &lt;&lt; current-&gt;data;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">System.out.println(current.data);</code> هيطبع <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code>.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 6, $q$Moving forward$q$, $q$بعدها؟$q$, $q$<span class="code-cpp">current = current-&gt;next</span><span class="code-java">current = current.next</span>$q$, $q$<span class="code-cpp">current = current-&gt;next</span><span class="code-java">current = current.next</span>$q$, $q$<div class="visual-box bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-8 mb-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-x-auto">
        
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-0 min-w-max py-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center mr-1">
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center animate-bounce-subtle">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded shadow-sm uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap">Head</div>
        <div class="w-0 h-0 border-x-[6px] border-x-transparent border-t-[7px] border-t-gray-900 mt-0.5"></div>
    </div>
        <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
    </div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
