            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-orange-400 bg-orange-50 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">10</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-1 bg-orange-400 relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-y-4 border-y-transparent border-l-[7px] border-l-orange-400"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center animate-bounce-subtle" style="animation-delay:0.1s">
        <div class="bg-teal-500 text-white font-bold text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded shadow-sm uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap">current</div>
        <div class="w-0 h-0 border-x-[6px] border-x-transparent border-t-[7px] border-t-teal-500 mt-0.5"></div>
    </div>
            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-brand-purple bg-brand-light text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">20</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-1 bg-brand-purple relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-y-4 border-y-transparent border-l-[7px] border-l-brand-purple"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-6"></div>
            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-teal-400 bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">30</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-0 border-t-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="h-6"></div>
        <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
        <div class="w-9 h-9 text-xs rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 font-bold bg-white flex-shrink-0">∅</div>
    </div></div>
    </div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>current = current-&gt;next;</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>current = current.next;</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p>I want to move to the next node. How? Use <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;next</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.next</code>, because <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">next</code> holds the address of what comes after.</p>
         <p>So: <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code></p>
         <p>Notice: we did <strong>not</strong> change Head. We changed <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code>.</p>$q$, $q$<p>عايز أروح للـ Node اللي بعدها. إزاي؟ أستخدم <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;next</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.next</code>، لأن next فيها عنوان اللي بعدها.</p>
         <p>فنقول: <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code></p>
         <p>لاحظ. مش غيرنا Head. إحنا غيرنا current.</p>$q$);
