    </div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>cout &lt;&lt; current-&gt;data;</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>System.out.println(current.data);</code></pre></div><div class="bg-gray-900 text-emerald-400 rounded-lg p-3 font-mono text-sm text-center" dir="ltr">20</div>$q$, $q$<p>If we print <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;data</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.data</code> now, it prints <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code>.</p>$q$, $q$<p>لو طبعنا <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;data</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.data</code> هتطلع <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code>.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 8, $q$Moving forward$q$, $q$بعدها$q$, $q$One more step: <span class="code-cpp">current-&gt;next</span><span class="code-java">current.next</span>$q$, $q$بعدها$q$, $q$<div class="visual-box bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-8 mb-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-x-auto">
        
