        <div class="w-9 h-9 text-xs rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 font-bold bg-white flex-shrink-0">∅</div>
    </div></div>
    </div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>current = current-&gt;next;</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>current = current.next;</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p><code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code> one more time.</p>
         <p>Notice: <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code> is now <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">null</code>.</p>$q$, $q$<p><code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code> تاني.</p>
         <p>لاحظ. current بقى <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">null</code>.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 10, $q$Stopping condition$q$, $q$إمتى نوقف؟$q$, $q$When current becomes <span class="code-cpp">NULL</span><span class="code-java">null</span>$q$, $q$أول ما current يبقى <span class="code-cpp">NULL</span><span class="code-java">null</span>$q$, $q$<div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">while</span>(current != <span class="text-orange-400">NULL</span>)</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">while</span> (current != <span class="text-orange-400">null</span>)</code></pre></div><div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">while</span>(current)</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-gray-500 italic">// Java always requires the explicit check</span>
<span class="text-brand-purple">while</span> (current != <span class="text-orange-400">null</span>)</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p>We stop the moment <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code> becomes <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">null</code>.</p>
         <p>That's: <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while(current != NULL)</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while (current != null)</code><span class="code-cpp">, or simply <code class=" bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while(current)</code></span><span class="code-java"> &mdash; Java has no shorthand for this, the explicit check is required.</span></p>
         <p>Each loop: <strong>print the data</strong>, then <strong>go to the next one</strong>.</p>$q$, $q$<p>أول ما current يبقى <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">null</code>.</p>
         <p>يعني <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while(current != NULL)</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while (current != null)</code><span class="code-cpp"> أو <code class=" bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while(current)</code></span><span class="code-java"> &mdash; في Java مفيش اختصار، لازم نكتب الشرط صريح.</span></p>
         <p>كل لفة: اطبع البيانات، ثم روح للي بعدها.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 11, $q$Putting it together$q$, $q$الكود الكامل$q$, $q$The full traversal code$q$, $q$الكود الكامل$q$, $q$<div class="code-cpp bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">Node*</span> current = Head;

<span class="text-brand-purple">while</span>(current != <span class="text-orange-400">NULL</span>)
{
    cout &lt;&lt; current-&gt;data &lt;&lt; endl;

    current = current-&gt;next;
}</code></pre></div><div class="code-java bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code><span class="text-brand-purple">Node</span> current = Head;

<span class="text-brand-purple">while</span> (current != <span class="text-orange-400">null</span>) {
    System.out.println(current.data);

    current = current.next;
}</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p>This is the most famous piece of code in all of Linked Lists.</p>$q$, $q$<p>وده أشهر كود في Linked List كلها.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 12, $q$Tracing it$q$, $q$نمشي عليه خطوة خطوة$q$, $q$Walking through it, step by step$q$, $q$نمشي عليه خطوة خطوة$q$, $q$<div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3 mb-2">
        <div class="bg-orange-50 border border-orange-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-orange-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Step 1</div>
            <div class="font-mono font-bold text-orange-600 text-lg">10</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-purple/20 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-brand-purple uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Step 2</div>
            <div class="font-mono font-bold text-brand-dark text-lg">20</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-teal-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Step 3</div>
            <div class="font-mono font-bold text-teal-600 text-lg">30</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-gray-100 border border-gray-300 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">Step 4</div>
            <div class="font-mono font-bold text-gray-500 text-lg"><span class="code-cpp">NULL</span><span class="code-java">null</span> &mdash; stop</div>
        </div>
    </div>$q$, $q$<p><strong>Start:</strong> current &rarr; 10. Print <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code>, then <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code></p>
         <p><strong>Second:</strong> current &rarr; 20. Print <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code>, then move on.</p>
         <p><strong>Third:</strong> current &rarr; 30. Print <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">30</code>, then move on.</p>
         <p><strong>Fourth:</strong> current &rarr; <span class="code-cpp">NULL</span><span class="code-java">null</span>. The <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">while</code> stops.</p>$q$, $q$<p><strong>البداية:</strong> current &larr; 10. يطبع <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code>، ثم <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code></p>
         <p><strong>الثانية:</strong> current &larr; 20. يطبع <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code>، ثم يكمل.</p>
         <p><strong>الثالثة:</strong> current &larr; 30. يطبع <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">30</code>، ثم يكمل.</p>
         <p><strong>الرابعة:</strong> current &larr; <span class="code-cpp">NULL</span><span class="code-java">null</span>. الـ while تقف.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 13, $q$Result$q$, $q$الناتج$q$, $q$Output$q$, $q$الناتج$q$, $q$<div class=" bg-[#1E1E2E] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-inner border border-gray-800 font-mono text-[13px] text-gray-300 leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto my-4" dir="ltr"><pre class="m-0"><code>10
20
30</code></pre></div>$q$, $q$<p>That's the full result of the traversal.</p>$q$, $q$<p>وده الناتج الكامل للـ Traversal.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 14, $q$A very important question$q$, $q$سؤال مهم جدًا$q$, $q$Why can't we do current++?$q$, $q$ليه ماينفعش أعمل current++؟$q$, $q$<div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 mb-4 overflow-x-auto">
        <table class="w-full text-sm font-mono min-w-[280px]">
            <thead><tr class="text-gray-400 text-xs uppercase"><th class="text-left pb-2">Node</th><th class="text-left pb-2">Address</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody class="text-gray-700">
                <tr class="border-t border-gray-200"><td class="py-2 font-bold text-orange-600">10</td><td class="py-2">1000</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-t border-gray-200"><td class="py-2 font-bold text-brand-dark">20</td><td class="py-2">50000</td></tr>
                <tr class="border-t border-gray-200"><td class="py-2 font-bold text-teal-600">30</td><td class="py-2">900</td></tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-rose-50 border border-rose-200 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
        <div class="font-mono text-sm text-rose-500">current++ &rarr; address 1001 &mdash; &#9888;&#65039; probably not a node</div>
    </div>$q$, $q$<p>Because the nodes aren't next to each other. Suppose memory looks like this: node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code> is at address <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">1000</code>, node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code> at <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">50000</code>, node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">30</code> at <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">900</code>.</p>
         <p>See? They're not adjacent. So if you did <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current++</code>, you'd jump to address <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">1001</code> &mdash; which probably has no node at all. The program crashes.</p>
         <p>The only correct way is <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code>, because <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">next</code> holds the real, correct address.</p>$q$, $q$<p>لأن الـ Nodes مش جنب بعض. افترض إن الذاكرة كده: Node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">10</code> في العنوان <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">1000</code>، Node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">20</code> في <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">50000</code>، Node <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">30</code> في <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">900</code>.</p>
         <p>شايفة؟ مش متجاورين. يعني لو عملت <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current++</code> هتروح للعنوان <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">1001</code>، وده غالبًا مفيهوش Node أصلًا. فالبرنامج هيبوظ.</p>
         <p>الطريقة الوحيدة هي <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next;</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next;</code>، لأن next فيها العنوان الصح.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 15, $q$An analogy you'll never forget$q$, $q$تشبيه يخليك مستحيل تنسى$q$, $q$The Treasure Hunt$q$, $q$Treasure Hunt$q$, $q$<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl mb-2">&#128506;&#65039;</div>
        <div class="text-sm text-amber-800 font-medium">Head &rarr; note 1 &rarr; note 2 &rarr; note 3 &rarr; treasure</div>
    </div>$q$, $q$<p>Imagine you're in a treasure hunt game. Every note says:</p>
         <p class="italic">"The next treasure is on such-and-such street, house number so-and-so."</p>
         <p>The first note you have is <strong>Head</strong>. You go to the place written on it. You find the next note. That note tells you where the third one is. And so on.</p>
         <p>You never, ever, know the location of the next note by yourself &mdash; each note has to tell you. That's exactly the role of the <strong>Next pointer</strong>.</p>$q$, $q$<p>تخيلي إنك في لعبة Treasure Hunt. كل ورقة مكتوب عليها:</p>
         <p class="italic">"الكنز اللي بعدي موجود في شارع كذا، بيت رقم كذا."</p>
         <p>أول ورقة معاك هي الـ <strong>Head</strong>. تروحي للمكان المكتوب. تلاقي الورقة التانية. الورقة التانية تقولك مكان التالتة. وهكذا.</p>
         <p>أنتِ عمرك ما تعرفي مكان الورقة اللي بعدها بنفسك، لازم كل ورقة تدلك على اللي بعدها. وده بالظبط هو دور <strong>Next Pointer</strong>.</p>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 16, $q$Recap$q$, $q$ملخص مهم تحفظيه$q$, $q$Summary$q$, $q$ملخص مهم تحفظيه$q$, $q$<div class="visual-box bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 sm:p-8 mb-6 shadow-sm relative overflow-x-auto">
        
        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-0 min-w-max py-2"><div class="flex flex-col items-center mr-1">
        <div class="relative flex flex-col items-center animate-bounce-subtle">
        <div class="bg-gray-900 text-white font-bold text-[10px] px-2.5 py-1 rounded shadow-sm uppercase tracking-wider whitespace-nowrap">Head</div>
        <div class="w-0 h-0 border-x-[6px] border-x-transparent border-t-[7px] border-t-gray-900 mt-0.5"></div>
    </div>
        <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
    </div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-6"></div>
            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-orange-400 bg-orange-50 text-orange-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">10</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-1 bg-orange-400 relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-y-4 border-y-transparent border-l-[7px] border-l-orange-400"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-6"></div>
            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-brand-purple bg-brand-light text-brand-dark flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">20</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-1 bg-brand-purple relative flex-shrink-0"><div class="absolute right-0 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-0 h-0 border-y-4 border-y-transparent border-l-[7px] border-l-brand-purple"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
            <div class="h-6"></div>
            <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
            <div class="w-16 h-16 text-xl rounded-2xl border-[3px] border-teal-400 bg-teal-50 text-teal-600 flex items-center justify-center font-bold node-3d flex-shrink-0">30</div>
        </div><div class="w-8 sm:w-10 h-0 border-t-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex-shrink-0"></div><div class="flex flex-col items-center">
        <div class="h-6"></div>
        <div class="w-0 h-4"></div>
        <div class="w-9 h-9 text-xs rounded-full border-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 flex items-center justify-center text-gray-400 font-bold bg-white flex-shrink-0">∅</div>
    </div></div>
    </div>$q$, $q$<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>Any operation on a Linked List starts from <strong>Head</strong>.</li>
            <li>We use a pointer called <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code> so we never change Head.</li>
            <li>We read data via <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;data</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.data</code>.</li>
            <li>We move to the next node via <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next</code>.</li>
            <li>We repeat until <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current == NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current == null</code>.</li>
            <li>Because nodes live in scattered memory locations, <strong>we can never use <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current++</code></strong> like we would with an array.</li>
         </ul>$q$, $q$<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2">
            <li>أي عملية على Linked List بتبدأ من <strong>Head</strong>.</li>
            <li>بنستخدم Pointer اسمه <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current</code> علشان منغيرش قيمة Head.</li>
            <li>بنقرأ البيانات من <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current-&gt;data</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current.data</code>.</li>
            <li>بننتقل للعنصر اللي بعده باستخدام <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current-&gt;next</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current = current.next</code>.</li>
            <li>بنكرر لحد ما <code class="code-cpp bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current == NULL</code><code class="code-java bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current == null</code>.</li>
            <li>لأن الـ Nodes موجودة في أماكن متفرقة في الذاكرة، <strong>مينفعش نستخدم <code class="bg-white border border-gray-200 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-mono text-sm">current++</code></strong> زي الـ Array.</li>
         </ul>$q$);
INSERT INTO lesson_slides (lesson_id, ordinal, kicker_en, kicker_ar, title_en, title_ar, visual, body_en, body_ar) VALUES (2, 17, $q$What's next$q$, $q$الجزء الجاي$q$, $q$Find, Insert &amp; Delete$q$, $q$Find و Insert و Delete$q$, $q$<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-2">
        <div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-purple/20 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-1">&#128270;</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark">Find (Search)</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-purple/20 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-1">&#10133;</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark">Insert</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-brand-light border border-brand-purple/20 rounded-xl p-4 text-center">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-1">&#10134;</div>
            <div class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-dark">Delete</div>
        </div>
    </div>$q$, $q$<p>The next part will be <strong>Find (Search)</strong>, and you'll see it's really just Traversal with one extra condition. After that, we'll dive into <strong>Insert</strong> and <strong>Delete</strong>, with step-by-step diagrams.</p>$q$, $q$<p>الجزء اللي بعده هيكون <strong>Find (البحث)</strong>، وهتشوفي إنه مجرد Traversal مع شرط إضافي، وبعدها هنبدأ ندخل على عمليات <strong>Insert</strong> و <strong>Delete</strong> برسومات خطوة بخطوة.</p>$q$);

SELECT setval(pg_get_serial_sequence('lessons', 'id'), (SELECT MAX(id) FROM lessons));
